:"Optional AbortController to abort when stream is cancelled"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"getId?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chunk"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"index"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional per-chunk durability offset; when present, each event gets an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id:"},{"type":"text","value":" line"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadableStream"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Uint8Array"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayBufferLike"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ReadableStream in Server-Sent Events format"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"stream","text":"stream","level":3},{"id":"abortcontroller","text":"abortController?","level":3},{"id":"getid","text":"getId?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction toServerSentEventsStream(\n   stream, \n   abortController?, \ngetId?): ReadableStream<Uint8Array<ArrayBufferLike>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts:296](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts#L296)\n\nConvert a StreamChunk async iterable to a ReadableStream in Server-Sent Events format\n\nThis creates a ReadableStream that emits chunks in SSE format:\n- Each chunk is prefixed with \"data: \"\n- Each chunk is followed by \"\\n\\n\"\n- Stream ends when the underlying iterable is exhausted (RUN_FINISHED is the terminal event)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### stream\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n\nAsyncIterable of StreamChunks from chat()\n\n### abortController?\n\n`AbortController`\n\nOptional AbortController to abort when stream is cancelled\n\n### getId?\n\n(`chunk`, `index`) => `string` \\| `undefined`\n\nOptional per-chunk durability offset; when present, each event gets an `id:` line\n\n## Returns\n\n`ReadableStream`\\<`Uint8Array`\\<`ArrayBufferLike`\\>\\>\n\nReadableStream in Server-Sent Events format\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: toServerSentEventsStream\ntitle: toServerSentEventsStream\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction toServerSentEventsStream(\n   stream, \n   abortController?, \ngetId?): ReadableStream<Uint8Array<ArrayBufferLike>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts:296](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-response.ts#L296)\n\nConvert a StreamChunk async iterable to a ReadableStream in Server-Sent Events format\n\nThis creates a ReadableStream that emits chunks in SSE format:\n- Each chunk is prefixed with \"data: \"\n- Each chunk is followed by \"\\n\\n\"\n- Stream ends when the underlying iterable is exhausted (RUN_FINISHED is the terminal event)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### stream\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n\nAsyncIterable of StreamChunks from chat()\n\n### abortController?\n\n`AbortController`\n\nOptional AbortController to abort when stream is cancelled\n\n### getId?\n\n(`chunk`, `index`) => `string` \\| `undefined`\n\nOptional per-chunk durability offset; when present, each event gets an `id:` line\n\n## Returns\n\n`ReadableStream`\\<`Uint8Array`\\<`ArrayBufferLike`\\>\\>\n\nReadableStream in Server-Sent Events format\n"}
